 "equipment_type": "Heat pump (air-to-water)",
 "applies_to": "LG THERMA V R32 Monobloc air-to-water heat pumps covered by installation manual MFL68026615 Rev.02 (North American models ZHBW041GA0 / ZHBW048GA0 / ZHBW055GA0), using the indoor PCB's own Modbus RTU slave port.",
 "summary": "The THERMA V monobloc can be run by a third-party controller over Modbus RTU wired to terminal block 3 (26 = A, 27 = B) on the indoor PCB, with no LG gateway. Coils switch space heating/cooling, hot water, silent mode and emergency functions; discrete inputs report pump, compressor, defrost, heater and error states; holding registers carry the operating mode, control method, setpoints and the smart-grid energy state; input registers give the error code, outdoor-unit cycle, flow rate and product type.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU"
 ],
