  "convention": "Modicon",
  "note": "The memory map prints Modicon numbers: coils 00001-, discrete inputs 10001-, input registers 30001-, holding registers 40001-. Drop the leading table digit and subtract one to get the wire address (40001 = holding register 0, 30009 = input register 8, 39999 = input register 9998)."
 },
